    "question_en": "Given tetrahedron ABCD, let G be the centroid of triangle BCD. Let M, N, and P be the midpoints of AB, BC, and CD, respectively. (a) Determine the line of intersection of planes (ADN) and (ABP). (b) Let I=AG\\cap MP and J=CM\\cap AN. Prove that D, I, and J are collinear.",
