    "question_en": "Two teams participate in a swimming competition. Team I has 7 athletes and Team II has 9. The probability that an athlete wins a gold medal is 0.07 for Team I and 0.06 for Team II. One athlete is selected at random. Determine whether each statement is true or false.",
